{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30389","headline":"题昭应王明府溪亭 · 赵嘏","name":"题昭应王明府溪亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"靖节何须彭泽逢，菊洲松岛水悠溶。\n行人自折门前柳，高鸟不离溪畔峰。\n晓渭度檐帆的的，晚原含雨树重重。\n轩车过尽无公事，枕上一声长乐钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}